<title>GERMANY: Allianz mulls purchase of GAN stake.</title>
<headline>Allianz mulls purchase of GAN stake.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>German insurance group Allianz AG Holding said on Wednesday that it was examining the possiblity of buying a stake in the French state insurance group GAN.</p>
<p>Allianz chairman Henning Schulte-Noelle said at the group's annual news conference that the group was &quot;looking&quot; at GAN, but that talks were at a very preliminary stage.</p>
<p>Schulte-Noelle said Allianz had been looking for some time at how exactly it could take advantage of opportunities in the French insurance market after the French government's plan to sell off its some of its interest in the sector takes place.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
